3. **License file** — ek `LICENSE` file bhi add kar dena (MIT license ka text Google pe mil jaayega)
4. **Star badge** — recruiter ko lagega tu professional hai
5. **Apna naam** already daal diya hai — **Vishakha Batmya** ✅

