🎯 Kyun Ye Sab Important Hai
Section	Kyun Zaroori
.env files	🔐 Gemini API key leak nahi hogi
__pycache__/	🐍 Python compiled files — junk
node_modules/	📦 200MB+ folder — push nahi karna
*.db	🗄️ SQLite DB auto-generate hoti hai
uploads/, outputs/	📤 User files — dynamic
.vscode/, .idea/	🎨 Personal IDE settings
.DS_Store, Thumbs.db	💻 OS junk files
*.log	📝 Log files — local only
⚠️ Important — Jo Tu Abhi Push Kar Chuki Hai
Tere pichle commit me ye files galti se push ho gayi thi:

backend/.env

frontend/.env

database/platform.db

Inhe ab remove karna padega. Ye commands chala:

powershell
# Step 1: Sensitive files ko Git tracking se hatao
git rm --cached backend/.env
git rm --cached frontend/.env
git rm --cached database/platform.db

# Step 2: .gitignore update karo (upar wala content paste kar)
# Step 3: Commit karo
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Remove sensitive files and add comprehensive .gitignore"

# Step 4: Push karo
git push
✅ Verify Karo — Kaam Hua Ya Nahi
powershell
git status
Agar .env files Untracked section me dikhein → ✅ Sahi hai
Agar Changes to be committed me dikhein → ❌ Kuch gadbad hai

Aur ye chala ke check kar kya track ho raha hai:

powershell
git ls-files | findstr .env
Agar sirf .env.example dikhe → ✅ Perfect
Agar .env bhi dikhe → ❌ Phir se git rm --cached chala

🎯 Bonus — .env.example File Bhi Bana
Ye file GitHub pe push karni hai (isse pata chalta hai kaunse env variables chahiye):

backend/.env.example:

env
# Gemini API Configuration
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./database/platform.db

# File Storage
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
OUTPUT_DIR=./outputs
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=50

# Server
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
DEBUG=True

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000
frontend/.env.example:

env
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
VITE_APP_NAME=Multi-Agent Data Platform
