## ✅ Ab Kya Karna

1. Ye README copy kar
2. Apni `README.md` file me paste kar (VS Code me khol)
3. Save kar
4. Push kar:

```powershell
git add README.md
git commit -m "Add detailed README"
git push
Bhai README ready hai. Ab bata — code dena shuru karein?

Sequence ye rahega:

backend/requirements.txt

backend/config.py

backend/database.py

backend/models/*

backend/agents/* (6 agents + orchestrator)

backend/api/*

backend/main.py

Frontend files

Database schema.sql

Bol, kahan se shuru karein? 🚀

gigitbore
📄 .gitignore File — Complete & Detailed
Ye le bhai, professional .gitignore jo tere multi-agent data platform project ke liye perfect hai. Ye file tere project ki sensitive files aur junk files ko GitHub pe jaane se rokegi.

📁 File Path
Project root me banao:

text
multi-agent-data-platform/.gitignore
📝 File Content (Copy-Paste Kar)
